# Build outputs must never enter the context: they bloat the upload and can shadow
# the container's own restore with host-built binaries.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.claude/
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/node_modules/

tests/
docs/
*.md
# ...except the runbook, which LineOps.Reliability embeds so the Ops desk can show it.
!docs/runbook.md

# Never bake local secrets into an image layer.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/.env
